{"id":"644084","name":"拌花菜","author":"乔拉","authorId":"7000253","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/644084/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"2根"},{"name":"熟花生米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"焯过水的木耳","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黄瓜拍一下，切块。","img":"images/644084/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入切好的香菜杆（也可以放香菜，只是借个味道）。","img":"images/644084/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入胡萝卜。","img":"images/644084/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入花生米。","img":"images/644084/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入木耳，放盐。","img":"images/644084/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入糖。","img":"images/644084/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入醋。","img":"images/644084/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入生抽。","img":"images/644084/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入蚝油。","img":"images/644084/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入蒜末。","img":"images/644084/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入辣椒油。","img":"images/644084/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/644084/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"拌酸甜口的凉菜，一般糖和醋一比一的比例就可以，如果喜欢偏酸一些，可以增加醋的比例。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}